<bridgehead renderas="sect3">Dependências do Gjs</bridgehead>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Exigidas</bridgehead>
    <para role="required">
      <xref linkend="cairo"/>, <xref linkend="dbus"/>, &gobject-introspection; e
<xref linkend="spidermonkey"/>
    </para>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Opcionais (para testes)</bridgehead>
    <para role="recommended">
      <xref linkend="gtk3"/>, <xref linkend="gtk4"/> e <xref linkend="valgrind"/>
    </para>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Opcionais</bridgehead>
    <para role="optional">
      <ulink url="https://dtrace.org/about/">DTrace</ulink>, <ulink
url="https://github.com/linux-test-project/lcov">LCOV</ulink>, <ulink
url="&sysprof-url;">sysprof</ulink> e <ulink
url="https://sourceware.org/systemtap">Systemtap</ulink>
    </para>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Instalação do Gjs</title>



    <!--
    <para>

      Apply a patch to allow building this package with SpiderMonkey 140:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../gjs-&gjs-version;-spidermonkey_140-1.patch</userinput></screen>
-->
<para>
      Instale o <application>Gjs</application> executando os seguintes comandos:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>mkdir gjs-build &amp;&amp;
cd    gjs-build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=/usr          \
            --buildtype=release    \
            --wrap-mode=nofallback \
            ..                     &amp;&amp;
ninja</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Para testar os resultados, certifique-se de que <xref linkend='gtk3'/> e
<xref linkend='gtk4'/> estejam ambos instalados e emita: <command>ninja
test</command> em uma sessão gráfica.
    </para>

    <para>
      Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class="username">root</systemitem>:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>ninja install</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="commands">
    <title>Explicações do Comando</title>

    <xi:include xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
      href="../../xincludes/meson-buildtype-release.xml"/>

    <xi:include xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
      href="../../xincludes/meson-wrap-nofallback.xml"/>

    <para>
      <option>-D profiler=disabled</option>: This switch prevents building the
profiler backend even if <ulink url="&sysprof-url;">sysprof</ulink> is
installed.
    </para>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="content">
    <title>Conteúdo</title>

